Description: A comprehensive R package to analyze and visualize rRNA 2'-O-ribose methylation (2'-O-Me), a key chemical modification essential for ribosomal function. rRMSAnalyzer provides user-friendly functions to process RiboMethSeq data, compute methylation scores (C-scores), adjust for batch effects, and generate publication-ready visualizations.
